<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{ date }} 시장 마감 브리프</title>
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 700;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_bold }}) format("woff2");
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum";
    font-weight: 300;
    src: url(data:font/woff2;base64,{{ font_light }}) format("woff2");
  }

  @page { size: A4; margin: 9mm 10mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --hy-deep: #2D2864;      /* 한양증권 CI 워드마크 색 */
    --hy-mid: #754BE4;       /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 중간색 */
    --hy-light: #AB7CFB;     /* 한양증권 CI 그라데이션 밝은색 */
    --hy-tint: #F5F3FA;      /* 옅은 배경 */
    --hy-tint-line: #E2DBF2;
    --ink: #1B1626;
    --ink-soft: #58536A;
    --ink-faint: #8F8A9E;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --up: #D6273C;
    --down: #1D4ED8;
    --heat-up-3: #C81E2C; --heat-up-3-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-2: #E2495A; --heat-up-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-up-1: #F4B7BE; --heat-up-1-fg: #6b1420;
    --heat-flat: #E9E6EF; --heat-flat-fg: var(--ink-soft);
    --heat-down-1: #B7C9F6; --heat-down-1-fg: #16306e;
    --heat-down-2: #5C87E8; --heat-down-2-fg: #fff;
    --heat-down-3: #1D4ED8; --heat-down-3-fg: #fff;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "KoPubDotum", "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.48;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  b, strong { font-weight: 700; }

  .masthead {
    padding: 7px 24px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep);
  }
  .masthead img { height: 20px; display: block; }
  .masthead .wrap-label { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .page { padding: 10px 24px 0 24px; }

  .eyebrow-tag {
    display: inline-block; background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff;
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    padding: 2px 8px; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .title-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
  .title-main h1 { margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 1.35; }
  .title-main .subtitle { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .byline-box {
    flex: none; width: 180px; border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
    padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .byline-box .dt { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .byline-box .gap { height: 3px; }
  .byline-box .who { font-weight: 700; color: var(--hy-deep); }

  .skk-box { border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); margin-top: 8px; }
  .skk-row { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .skk-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .skk-label {
    flex: none; width: 68px; background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 5px 4px;
  }
  .skk-text { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 11.5px; display: flex; align-items: center; }

  h2 {
    font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin: 14px 0 6px 0;
  }
  h2 .h2-note { font-weight: 300; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); float: right; }

  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11.5px; }
  table.ruled { border-top: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--hy-deep); }
  table.ruled th { background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff; border-bottom: none; }
  th, td { padding: 4px 7px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; vertical-align: top; }
  th { font-weight: 700; }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tr + tr td { border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .up { color: var(--up); font-weight: 700; }
  .down { color: var(--down); font-weight: 700; }
  .note-col { text-align: left; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }

  .flow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin: 6px 0 0 0; }
  .info-box { border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .info-box .ibhead {
    background: var(--hy-tint); color: var(--hy-deep); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
  }
  .info-box .ibbody { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .info-box .ibbody .up, .info-box .ibbody .down { font-weight: 700; }

  .chart-wrap { margin-top: 8px; text-align: center; }
  .chart-wrap img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: inline-block; }

  .heatmap { position: relative; height: 195px; margin-top: 5px; }
  .heat-box {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 2px 4px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden;
    outline: 1px solid var(--paper);
  }
  .heat-box .hname { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 100%; }
  .heat-box .hpct { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .heat-box .hwt { font-size: 9px; opacity: 0.85; }
  .heat-up-3 { background: var(--heat-up-3); color: var(--heat-up-3-fg); }
  .heat-up-2 { background: var(--heat-up-2); color: var(--heat-up-2-fg); }
  .heat-up-1 { background: var(--heat-up-1); color: var(--heat-up-1-fg); }
  .heat-flat { background: var(--heat-flat); color: var(--heat-flat-fg); }
  .heat-down-1 { background: var(--heat-down-1); color: var(--heat-down-1-fg); }
  .heat-down-2 { background: var(--heat-down-2); color: var(--heat-down-2-fg); }
  .heat-down-3 { background: var(--heat-down-3); color: var(--heat-down-3-fg); }

  .heat-legend { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 6px 0 4px 0; }
  .heat-legend .bar {
    flex: 1; height: 7px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--heat-down-3), var(--heat-down-1), var(--heat-flat), var(--heat-up-1), var(--heat-up-3));
  }
  .sector-source { font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: right; margin-bottom: 4px; }

  .pill-strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .pill-neutral { color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 700; }
  .pill-weak { color: var(--down); font-weight: 700; }

  .stance-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .stance-col { border: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .stance-head { background: var(--hy-deep); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 4px 10px; text-align: center; }
  .stance-body { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.55; }

  .compliance { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line); }
  .compliance .heading { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .compliance ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 14px; }
  .compliance li { font-size: 10px; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom: 2px; list-style: none; position: relative; }
  .compliance li::before { content: "·"; color: var(--hy-mid); position: absolute; left: -10px; }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hy-tint-line);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
  }
  .footer img { height: 14px; opacity: 0.8; flex: none; }
  .footer .disclaimer { font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="masthead">
  <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
  <div class="wrap-label">DAILY MARKET WRAP · {{ branch_name }}</div>
</div>

<div class="page">

  <div class="eyebrow-tag">{{ eyebrow }}</div>

  <div class="title-row">
    <div class="title-main">
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="byline-box">
      <div class="dt">{{ date }} ({{ weekday }}) 장마감</div>
      <div>발행 {{ generated_at }} · 당일 배포</div>
      <div class="gap"></div>
      <div class="who">{{ branch_name }} {{ department }}</div>
      <div>{{ author }}</div>
      <div>{{ contact }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="skk-box">
    <div class="skk-row"><div class="skk-label">SIGNAL</div><div class="skk-text">{{ signal }}</div></div>
    <div class="skk-row"><div class="skk-label">KEY</div><div class="skk-text">{{ key_point }}</div></div>
    <div class="skk-row"><div class="skk-label">STEP</div><div class="skk-text">{{ step }}</div></div>
  </div>

  <h2>Ⅰ. 지수 · 대외 지표</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
    <tr><th>구분</th><th>종가</th><th>전일비</th><th>등락률</th><th class="note-col">해석</th></tr>
    {% for i in indicators -%}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ i.label }}</td>
      <td>{{ i.close }}</td>
      <td class="{{ i.trend_class }}">{{ i.change_pt }}</td>
      <td class="{{ i.trend_class }}">{{ i.change_pct }}</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ i.note }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>

  <div class="flow-grid">
    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="ibhead">투자자별 순매수 (억원)</div>
      <div class="ibbody">
        KOSPI &nbsp;외국인 <b>{{ flows.kospi.foreign }}</b>
        · 기관 <b>{{ flows.kospi.inst }}</b>
        · 개인 <b>{{ flows.kospi.retail }}</b><br>
        KOSDAQ 외국인 <b>{{ flows.kosdaq.foreign }}</b>
        · 기관 <b>{{ flows.kosdaq.inst }}</b>
        · 개인 <b>{{ flows.kosdaq.retail }}</b><br>
        선물 &nbsp;&nbsp;{{ flows.futures }}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="ibhead">시장 폭 (Breadth)</div>
      <div class="ibbody">
        상승 / 하락 &nbsp;<b>{{ breadth.advance_decline }}</b> — {{ breadth.note }}<br>
        거래대금 &nbsp;{{ breadth.trading_value }}<br>
        신용잔고 &nbsp;{{ breadth.margin_balance }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if chart_png %}
  <div class="chart-wrap"><img src="{{ chart_png }}" alt="지수 추이 차트"></div>
  {% endif %}

  <h2>Ⅱ. 업종 동향 맵 <span class="h2-note">박스 크기 = 시가총액 비중, 색 = 당일 등락률</span></h2>
  <div class="heatmap">
    {% for s in sectors -%}
    <div class="heat-box {{ s.heat_class }}" style="left:{{ s.x_pct }}%; top:{{ s.y_pct }}%; width:{{ s.w_pct }}%; height:{{ s.h_pct }}%;">
      <div class="hname">{{ s.name }}</div>
      <div class="hpct">{{ s.change_pct }}%</div>
      {% if not s.compact %}
      <div class="hwt">{{ s.weight_pct }}%</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="heat-legend"><span>-3%</span><div class="bar"></div><span>+3%</span></div>
  <div class="sector-source">자료: KRX, 한양증권 {{ branch_name }} 재구성</div>
  <p>{{ sector_prose }}</p>

  <h2>Ⅲ. 이슈 종목 — 왜 움직였고, 이어질 것인가</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
    <tr><th class="nowrap">종목</th><th class="nowrap">등락률</th><th class="note-col">움직인 이유 (뉴스·수급·실적)</th><th class="nowrap">지속성</th><th class="note-col">언제·무엇을 확인</th></tr>
    {% for s in issue_stocks -%}
    <tr>
      <td class="nowrap">{{ s.name }}({{ s.ticker }})</td>
      <td class="{{ s.trend_class }} nowrap">{{ s.trend_symbol }} {{ s.change_pct }}%</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ s.reason }}</td>
      <td class="{{ s.persistence_class }} nowrap">{{ s.persistence }}</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ s.checkpoint }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>

  <h2>Ⅳ. 캘린더 — 언제, 무엇을, 왜 봐야 하나 <span class="h2-note">시각은 한국시간 기준</span></h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ruled">
    <tr><th>일시</th><th class="note-col">이벤트</th><th>중요도</th><th class="note-col">체크포인트 / 영향 종목</th></tr>
    {% for c in calendar -%}
    <tr style="{{ 'background:var(--hy-tint);' if c.high else '' }}">
      <td style="white-space:nowrap;">{{ c.datetime }}</td>
      <td class="note-col" style="{{ 'font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);' if c.high else '' }}">{{ c.event }}</td>
      <td style="letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--hy-mid);">{{ c.stars }}</td>
      <td class="note-col">{{ c.checkpoint }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>

  <h2>지점 대응 요약 — 이번 주</h2>
  <div class="stance-grid">
    <div class="stance-col"><div class="stance-head">유지</div><div class="stance-body">{{ stance.maintain }}</div></div>
    <div class="stance-col"><div class="stance-head">축소</div><div class="stance-body">{{ stance.reduce }}</div></div>
    <div class="stance-col"><div class="stance-head">현금·안내</div><div class="stance-body">{{ stance.cash }}</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="compliance">
    <div class="heading">Compliance Notice</div>
    <ul>
      <li>본 자료는 지점 내부 참고자료로, 제3자에게 사전 제공된 사실이 없습니다.</li>
      <li>작성자는 자료 작성일 현재 본 자료에 언급된 종목과 재산적 이해관계가 없습니다.</li>
      <li>본 자료의 수치는 언론 보도 및 시장 데이터를 정리한 것으로 당사 리서치센터의 공식 견해가 아니며, 정확성·완전성을 보장하지 않습니다.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <img src="{{ logo_compact }}" alt="한양증권">
    <div class="disclaimer">작성·문의: 한양증권 {{ branch_name }} {{ department }} {{ author }} ({{ contact }}) · 투자 권유 목적이 아니며 투자판단의 책임은 투자자 본인에게 있습니다.</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
